{title: Joy to the World}
{artist: Isaac Watts, 1719}
{key: D}
{tempo: 100}
{difficulty: beginner}
{tags: holiday, hymn}

[D]Joy to the [G]world, [A]the Lord is [D]come
Let earth re[G]ceive [A]her [D]King
Let every heart prepare Him room
And heaven and nature sing
And [A]heaven and nature sing
And [D]heaven, and [G]heaven, [D]and [A]nature [D]sing
